    <string name="privacy_1">This app has no network permission. Your photos and analysis never leave the phone.</string>
    <string name="privacy_2">The analysis cache, marks and cleaning history live only in the app\'s private storage and are removed when you uninstall.</string>
    <string name="privacy_3">Deletion goes through the system media store, which asks you to confirm again.</string>
    <string name="set_about">About</string>
    <string name="about_version">%1$s %2$s (%3$d) · Android %4$s</string>
    <string name="about_ml">On-device Google ML Kit and MediaPipe models detect similar photos, content (documents, QR codes, food, pets, scenery), text and facial expressions. The quality score estimates sharpness, exposure and contrast.</string>
    <string name="about_favorites">Photos you favorited in your gallery are never marked for deletion.</string>
    <string name="about_language">The app follows your system language (Chinese / English). On Android 13+ you can also set it in Settings › Apps › Photo Cleaner › Language.</string>
    <string name="perm_intro">Find similar photos, screenshots, blurry and badly lit shots, and clean them up with a swipe.\nPhoto access is required.</string>
    <string name="perm_privacy">Everything is analyzed on the phone. No network permission, nothing is uploaded. The system asks again before deleting.</string>
